        >
          Only a fraction are actually used.
        </div>

        <div
          style={{
            opacity: captionProgress,
            transform: `translateY(${interpolate(captionProgress, [0, 1], [20, 0])}px)`,
            fontSize: 40,
            fontWeight: 400,
            color: COLORS.muted,
            letterSpacing: "-0.01em",
            textAlign: "center",
          }}
        >
          Those are the ones that drive reach.
        </div>
      </AbsoluteFill>
